Letter to the Editor

Prominence eruption observed in He II 304 Å up to >6 R�
by EUI/FSI aboard Solar Orbiter

M. Mierla1, 2, A. N. Zhukov1, 3, D. Berghmans1, S. Parenti4, F. Auchère4, P. Heinzel5, 6, D. B. Seaton7, E. Palmerio8,
